sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Live UI (SI-05)
    participant DP as Data Prep (DP-01/02/03)
    participant SYS as System Engine
    participant MT as Matching Engine (MT-01..06)
    participant BE as Banking Exceptions (BE-01..07)
    participant LS as Learning & Scoring (LS-01..06)
    participant HR as Human Reasoning Layer (HR-01..04)
    participant SR as Safety Checks (SR-01..08)

    U->>UI: Upload Bank + Ledger Files
    UI->>DP: Validate + Clean + Map (DP-01..03)
    DP-->>UI: Diagnostics + OK to proceed

    UI->>SYS: Start Reconciliation
    SYS->>MT: Run all match types (MT-01..06)
    SYS->>BE: Run exception paths (BE-01..07)
    SYS->>HR: Behavior understanding (HR-01..04)
    SYS->>LS: Score + rank all candidates (LS-01..06)
    SYS->>SR: Apply Safety Rules (SR-01..08)

    SYS-->>UI: Show suggestions + Convergence % (SI-05)

    U->>UI: Review & Confirm/Override (UA-01/02)
    UI->>SR: Validate safety before approval
    SR-->>UI: Confirm safe (or warn)

    UI->>LS: Learn from user changes (LS-03/04)
    LS->>SYS: Update scoring + thresholds

    SYS-->>UI: Live update results + Convergence %

    loop Until 100% Coverage Achieved
        U->>UI: Continue approvals
        UI->>SYS: Re-evaluate remaining matches
        SYS-->>UI: Progress updates
    end

    SYS-->>UI: Final Report (No blind auto - SI-04)
    UI-->>U: All matched or justified ✅
